        ("3.5", "Preliminary Product Description", "The product is a Digital Defense Hub console and API platform. Users interact through React workspaces; protected actions flow to the Go backend; the backend persists records in PostgreSQL and calls the FastAPI engine for incident or pre-encryption scoring and supported media analysis.", "dashboard requests; deployments; event/incident records; evidence/media jobs", "REST contracts, RBAC, tenant context, worker workflows and source-hash verification", "Security dashboards and investigation records backed by persistent service workflows."),
